Z||000000||deceler8||11-03-2000||05:34 PM||||Well, Mr. Gore's folks really pulled off the so-called "October Surprise"...Bush nailed for DUI...<P>Right on the heels of trying to convince Nader supporters that ol' Ralphie is gay...<P>I guess anything goes when it comes to politics. The "Nader is gay" thing should have inflamed most of Hollywood's Gore supporters, not to mention Barney Frank. After all, I thought it was okay to be gay ?<P>And the Bush DUI thing (nearly a quarter century ago...is that all they can find ?) really points out one thing...Bush's only mistake is that he wasn't born a Kennedy.<P>Mr. Gore is really playing with dynamite. After all, he has supported his boss through thick and thin, and some of the stuff Mr. Clinton has done is just shameful. Add to that Mr. Gore's questionable campaign fundraising tactics and it's pretty clear that he's scared.<P>And the Bush story is a dangerous precedent...making the claim that an arrest a quarter century ago is a basis for denying one a position...if this comes to pass, how many of us will be looking over our shoulders?<P>This editorial comment was brought to you by the 1986 Fiero 2M4...Driving Excitement, even when you're not sloshed...||||reg||1
